TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Pekâlâ, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Beni {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'a{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sen
